Colorset 27 fg #000000, bg #028383, hi, sh, Plain, NoShape
Colorset 31 fg #000000, bg #c5c5c5, hi, sh, Plain, NoShape
Colorset 37 fg #ffffff, bg #4b88a4, hi, sh, Plain, NoShape

